# E0b6 quadrature development probe

Final implementation: fixed 5-point Gauss-Legendre on each span interval, split at profile endpoints, the inner and outer occupancy radii, and the regularized core radius. The swirl correction subtracts two absolute `Aero.tail_surface_load` results; their common free-stream load cancels.

Independent reference: composite midpoint integration with 8,192 samples per profile interval. The synthetic, uncalibrated E0b3b fixture supplies actual chord, occupancy, local core-regularized swirl, body rates, and the tail load law.

Candidate in `/tmp/e0b6_fast_candidate`: the 41-check swirl accuracy suite passed with 0 failures; its 8,192-sample probe passed. The same module was copied to the app and the probe rerun below.

Final command: `$(app/get-godot.sh) --headless --path app --script "$PWD/research/propwash/e0b6/quadrature_probe.gd"`.

All corrections are finite. Peak normalized force and moment errors are 1.03503390e-6 and 1.02362268e-6, respectively, in the reverse-fade midpoint case. The target is 1e-3.

